ries":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0bFgBWMmCTXwGT932s6z2A","review_id":"_Zx_MF8NcagSXA8LF6elsQ","date":"2021-11-12T05:13:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9167494773864746,"text_excerpt":"Staff were super helpful & work hard. Grateful they are open. Great coffee in a convenient location"},{"business_id":"0bFgBWMmCTXwGT932s6z2A","review_id":"lj6Nlirp-XfRYsT8oKI9rw","date":"2017-08-23T18:45:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8998985886573792,"text_excerpt":"This PJ's is located inside the Doubletree Hotel on Canal. On the day that I was working an event at the hotel, this PJ's was a lifesaver. The store itself is small, but has a few tables and chairs. The coffee was good and the staff was fast and friendly. I was here at 10am and, for some reason, they were in the middle of a staff change and could only accept cards. That wasn't a big deal, but I've never experienced that at other locations. A large iced coffee came to about $3.47, which is a bit cheaper than my regular PJ's, so I was happy."},{"business_id":"0bFgBWMmCTXwGT932s6z2A","review_id":"4p4ynW_zZQs9fEV9955nEw","date":"2017-11-12T13:23:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8981820940971375,"text_excerpt":"I stopped in this nice little coffee shop when in desperate need of cup of Joe. I found the staff to be very friendly and the coffee strong! At the time that I went early on a Sunday morning there wasn't a wait."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0bFgBWMmCTXwGT932s6z2A","photo_id":"8CuNjgXgpXoeruadCUVo_Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8CuNjgXgpXoeruadCUVo_Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.